      "id": "claim_2e1ca4efdcee4aa69ec64eb843e26099",
      "statement": "The per-package test task is a Vite+ task rather than a script (a task may not share a name with a script) so its input can exclude the scratch paths vitest writes and reads back (node_modules/.vite, node_modules/.vite-temp, .wrangler/validate), because vp declines to cache a task that reads a path it also wrote.",
